@HostelHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:7000

### 1. Create a new maintenance ticket
POST {{HostelHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "title": "Leaking Pipe",
  "description": "Bathroom sink in room 204 is leaking",
  "roomNumber": "204",
  "status": "Open",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-19T18:00:00Z"
}

### 2. Get all tickets
GET {{HostelHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets

### 3. Get ticket by ID
GET {{HostelHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1